A||||14||Tigger||People do strange things to their cars...||||10||
Z||000000||Tigger||11-29-2000||10:10 PM||||This picture is real - not doctored in anyway - and was taken last week in Waldorf by a Transportation Supervisor for a company that delivers building materials for 84 Lumber.  When he saw it in the parking lot of IHOP, he went and bought a camera to take pictures.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/waldorf.jpg"> <P>The car is still running as can be witnessed by the exhaust.  A woman is either asleep or otherwise out in the front seat passenger side.  The guy driving it was over jogged up and down on Rt. 925 in the background.  The witnesses said their physical state was OTHER than normal and the police just shook their heads in amazement.  The driver finally came back after the police were there and was getting down at the back to cut the 'twine around the load.  They told him to get back until it was taken off.<P>The materials were loaded at Home Depot.  Their store manager said they had the customer sign a waiver!<P>Both back tires are trashed.  The rear shocks were driven up through the floorboard.  In the back seat were 10 bags, 80 lbs. each of concrete.  On the roof are many 2x4's, 4x4's, and sheets of OSB.  They estimated the load weight at 3000 lbs.  The car is a VW Jetta with FL plates and the guy said he was headed for Annapolis.<P>JUST UNBELIEVABLE!!!!<P><BR>Hehe... hope this one wasn't on the forum before, a friend emailed this one to me at work.<P>Looks like the guy went to take off and the load shifted back, totally trashing the car!<P>------------------<BR>T-T-F-N, Tah Tah For Now!<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/tiggerblue2.gif"> ||||reg||10
Z||000001||Hank is Here||11-29-2000||10:14 PM||||Darn, I just thought that was an alternative to lowering springs<P>I wonder how this guy would do dealing with a buterfly ballot?<P>||||reg||1
Z||000002||Fformula88||11-29-2000||11:19 PM||||Butterfly ballot?  He'd probably try to use the ballot as a package shelf in his trunk to pile in more concrete  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  <P>Maybe this is the new "Euro" look to challenge the ricer look of modded Honda's?!?<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.geocities.com/formula2m6/FIEROSIG1.JPG">  <BR>1988 Fiero Formula||||reg||1
Z||000003||sqoach||11-30-2000||12:35 AM||||i didn't know people where THAT stupid.  damn, common sense should tell you that you can't load a car with something more than it weighs, especially on the top of a car!  on the roof!! i can't get over that.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/eek.gif"><P>------------------<BR>sQoaCh||||reg||11
